{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"Azumaya 范畴"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"Azumaya范畴"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"范畴论","text":"范畴论"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>Azumaya 范畴是 "},{"Local":{"url":"Azumaya代数","text":"Azumaya 代数"}},{"Plain":"在"},{"Local":{"url":"充实范畴","text":"充实范畴"}},{"Plain":"中的推广.</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>参考 "},{"Local":{"url":"BorceuxVitaleAzumayaCategory","text":"Borceux–Vitale"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>设 $\\mathcal V$ 为余完备"},{"Local":{"url":"闭范畴","text":"闭"}},{"Local":{"url":"对称幺半范畴","text":"对称幺半范畴"}},{"Plain":". 记 $\\mathcal I$ 为仅有一个对象 $*$ 且满足 $\\operatorname{Hom}(*,*)=1$ 的 $\\mathcal V$-"},{"Local":{"url":"充实范畴","text":"充实范畴"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>对于 $\\mathcal V$-"},{"Local":{"url":"充实范畴","text":"充实范畴"}},{"Plain":" $A$, 如下条件等价:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>存在 $\\mathcal V$-"},{"Local":{"url":"充实范畴","text":"充实范畴"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal B$, 使得 $A\\otimes\\mathcal B$ "},{"Local":{"url":"Morita等价","text":"Morita 等价"}},{"Plain":"于 $\\mathcal I$.</li>\n<li>$\\mathcal A\\otimes\\mathcal A^{\\mathrm{op}}$ "},{"Local":{"url":"Morita等价","text":"Morita 等价"}},{"Plain":"于 $\\mathcal I$.</li>\n<li>$\\mathcal A$ 为中心可分 $\\mathcal V$-充实范畴, 且典范函子 $\\mathcal A\\otimes\\mathcal A^{\\mathrm{op}} \\to\\mathcal V$ 为 $\\mathcal A\\otimes\\mathcal A^{\\mathrm{op}}$-模中的强生成元.</li>\n<li>典范函子 $\\mathcal A\\otimes\\mathcal A^{\\mathrm{op}} \\to\\mathcal V$ "},{"Local":{"url":"全忠实函子","text":"全忠实"}},{"Plain":", 且作为 $(\\mathcal A\\otimes\\mathcal A^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathcal I)$-"},{"Local":{"url":"充实范畴上的模","text":"双模"}},{"Plain":", 为小投射强生成元.</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>注</strong>. "},{"Local":{"url":"Azumaya代数","text":"Azumaya 代数"}},{"Plain":"是上述概念 $\\mathcal V = \\mathsf{Mod}(R)$ 的特殊情形.</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"充实范畴上的模","text":"充实范畴上的模"}},{"Plain":"页面解释了上述定义中涉及的概念. 这些概念都是环上的模与代数的类似概念的推广.</p>\n"}]}}